# Reliability

- A click/save/redirect is not success. Only VERIFIED after read-back compare.
- Prefer MANUAL_REVIEW_REQUIRED over guessing.
- On ADMIN_CONTRACT_DRIFT: block production writes.
- Never mark WRITTEN as complete.
- Retry only when error taxonomy says retry is safe; never retry drift/auth by guessing.
- Preserve audit artifacts for every run.
